<%= content_for :title, t('.title') %>
<%= content_for :meta_tags do %>
  <meta name="description" content="<%= t(".meta_description") %>" />
<% end %>


<div class="background-full-color flex-container text-center">
	<div class="background-title flex-item">
		<h1>How it works?</h1>
	</div>
</div>

<div class="discover-white text-center">
	<div class="discover-title">
		Fiatope gives you the means to act for the emergence of Africa
	</div>
</div>

<div class="info text-center">
	Whether you are a project leader or want to support a project, we answer all your questions.
</div>

<div class="container">
	<div class="row">
		<div class="col-sm-6 padded-width">
			<div class="red-border">
				<div class="col-title flex-container text-center">
					<div class="flex-item">
						FAQ/HELP
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-content">
					<ul>
						<h2>PROJECTS</h2>
						<li>
							What types of projects are found on Fiatope?
						</li>
						<li>
							Contribute to a project
						</li>
						<li>
								Is it possible to contribute anonymously?
						</li>
						<li>
							What if the project I supported did not reach the minimum required?
						</li>
						<li>
							How to start a project?
						</li>
						<li>
							How to present your project?
						</li>
						<li>
							Which Projects are eligible?
						</li>
						<li>
							How to set the objectives of the project?
						</li>
						<li>
							How to inform your network
						</li>
						<li>
							How to promote a campaign?
						</li>
						<li>
							Is it possible to change project information?
						</li>
						<li>
							How to cancel a project?
						</li>
						<li>
							On what principle does funding work?
						</li>
						<li>
							How are the funds perceived?
						</li>

						<h4>FIATOPE</h4>

						<li>
							Who can use Fiatope? How much does it cost?
						</li>
						<li>
							Quel accompagnement Fiatope ?
						</li>
						<li>
							What is the amount of commission charged by Fiatope?
						</li>
						<li>
							What is the process of selection of projects?
						</li>
						<li>
							The contribution and collection collection circuit on Fiatope
						</li>

						<h4>ACCOUNT</h4>
						<li>
							How to manage your profile?
						</li>
					</ul>						
				</div>
				<div class="col-btn">
					<%= link_to 'Access the FAQ', faq_path, class: 'btn-medium-red-nm btn-block text-center' %>
				</div>
			</div>
			

		</div>
		<div class="col-sm-6 padded-width">
			<div class="red-border">
				<div class="col-title text-center">
					GUIDE TO SUCCESSFUL PROJECT
				</div>
				<div class="col-content">
					<ul>
						<h4>KEY INFORMATION ON YOUR PROJECT </h4>
						<li>The description of your project in a few words</li>
						<li>The financial objective to be achieved</li>
						<li>The duration of the fundraising</li>
					</ul>
					<ul>
						<h4>WHAT YOU WILL NEED TO SUCCEED</h4>
						<li>Determination and commitment</li>
						<li>A good detailed presentation of the project</li>
						<li>Beautiful Pictures</li>
						<li>A landmark video</li>
						<li>Video highlights</li>
						<li>A continuous commitment</li>
						<li>Do advantageous presentation of yourself (your bio)</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="col-btn">
					<%= link_to 'Access the GUIDE', successful_path, class: 'btn-medium-red-nm btn-block text-center' %>

				</div>
			</div>

		</div>
	</div>
</div>
